msgid "The Partihandel address must start with https://"
msgstr "Partihandel-adressen måste börja med https://"

#. module: partihandel_connector
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:partihandel_connector.field_res_config_settings__partihandel_url
msgid ""
"The address you use to log in to Partihandel, for example "
"https://app.partihandel.se"
msgstr ""
"Adressen du loggar in i Partihandel med, till exempel "
"https://app.partihandel.se"

#. module: partihandel_connector
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:partihandel_connector.partihandel_setup_wizard_view_form
msgid ""
"The integration user already exists. A new API key replaces the current one,\n"
"                        and Partihandel stops syncing until you paste the new key into Partihandel."
msgstr ""
"Integrationsanvändaren finns redan. En ny API-nyckel ersätter den nuvarande,\n"
"                        och Partihandel slutar synka tills du klistrar in den nya nyckeln i Partihandel."

#. module: partihandel_connector
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:partihandel_connector.partihandel_setup_wizard_view_form
msgid ""
"The user cannot log in to Odoo. It only signs in with the API key you get on the next step.\n"
"                        It is an internal user, so on a paid Odoo plan it counts as one user."
msgstr ""
"Användaren kan inte logga in i Odoo. Den loggar bara in med API-nyckeln du får i nästa steg.\n"
"                        Den är en intern användare, så på en betald Odoo-plan räknas den som en användare."

#. module: partihandel_connector
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:partihandel_connector.partihandel_setup_wizard_view_form
msgid ""
"This database's web address does not use https. Partihandel only connects over https,\n"
"                    so set the system parameter <code>web.base.url</code> to your https address first."
msgstr ""
"Den här databasens webbadress använder inte https. Partihandel ansluter bara över https,\n"
"                    så ställ först in systemparametern <code>web.base.url</code> på din https-adress."

#. module: partihandel_connector
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:partihandel_connector.field_partihandel_setup_wizard__odoo_url
msgid "URL"
msgstr "URL"

